  m_Name: Jonas_Starting_Dialogue
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  dialogue:
  - It has finally come to this...
  - ...Jonas.
  - With your efforts, you have successfully turned our city, Himik, into a hopeful
    paradise...
  - ...like what we have dreamt about for years.
  - As the modern symbol of peace and hope of Himik...
  - ...I, the King of Himik, sincerely congratulate you.
  - I bestow upon you the prestigious title of 'The P-'
